OL,3,A'People call them pervert glasses':
OL,4,ABlind users fear backlash over smart
OL,5,Atech
OL,6,
OL,7,FFraser Fleming approaches the corner of
OL,8,Fa busy Glasgow city centre street and
OL,9,Fasks his smart glasses to describe the
OL,10,Froad ahead.
OL,12,FA voice coming from tiny speakers in
OL,13,Fthe arms of the specs tells him there
OL,14,Fare several parked cars and a person
OL,15,Fwalking in his direction.
OL,17,FFor 44-year-old Fraser, who is
OL,18,Fregistered blind, this is "game
OL,19,Fchanging" information.
OL,21,F"I know how to approach the street and
OL,22,Fwhat sort of care to take," he says.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
